%% Behavior authority: internal/gate/gate.go (Run), internal/gate/survey.go, internal/affected/affected.go and README.md (Gates).
%% Invalid input exits before record creation. Admission findings reconcile and finish as an incomplete failed attempt, recorded when enabled.
%% Affected selection covers registered work, not a complete census. A valid empty result does not trigger fallback; unresolved verification scopes still run.
%% list uses complete discovery separately. A full local gate activates only sources owning selected members; effective-full CI activates every source.
flowchart TB
  Input["Validate configuration and revisions<br/><small>Admission runs before project execution</small>"]
  Invalid["Report input or load error<br/><small>No records are written</small>"]
  Rejected["Reconcile admission findings<br/><small>No Nx, preparation, discovery or execution</small>"]
  Members["Gate members<br/><small>• check and commit opt in independently<br/>• push includes all except skip-push<br/>• CI includes all verifications</small>"]
  Mode{"Affected requested?<br/><small>Host supplies the comparison base</small>"}
  Nx{"Usable Nx result?"}
  Full["Keep all gate members<br/><small>Effective mode: full</small>"]
  Affected["Keep affected and unresolved members<br/><small>Commands have unknown dependency scope</small>"]
  Census{"CI with effective full mode?"}
  All["Activate every source<br/><small>Complete discovery, including unregistered work</small>"]
  Selected["Activate selected sources<br/><small>Inactive sources are not judged missing or stale</small>"]
  Discover["Prepare and discover<br/><small>Only active sources need preparation</small>"]
  Reconcile["Reconcile and restore co-runs<br/><small>Required partners must share gate membership</small>"]
  Run["Execute runnable selections<br/><small>Shared process limit and command-exclusive tokens</small>"]
  Finish["Aggregate verdict and record when enabled<br/><small>Keep outcomes distinct from selection and omission</small>"]

  Input -->|Invalid input or load failure| Invalid
  Input -->|Admission rejected| Rejected
  Rejected -->|Incomplete failed attempt| Finish
  Input -->|Admitted| Members
  Members --> Mode
  Mode -->|No| Full
  Mode -->|Yes| Nx
  Nx -->|Unavailable or failed: record fallback| Full
  Nx -->|Valid, including empty| Affected
  Full --> Census
  Affected --> Census
  Census -->|Yes, including fallback| All
  Census -->|No| Selected
  All --> Discover
  Selected --> Discover
  Discover --> Reconcile --> Run --> Finish

  classDef em fill:#173d25,stroke:#86efac
  class Affected,Census em
